<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Transmisión en vivo | Río de Gloria</title>

<style>
*{
  margin:0;
  padding:0;
  box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%,rgba(0,120,220,.16),transparent 30%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 85% 70%,rgba(0,90,190,.15),transparent 28%),
    linear-gradient(180deg,#00101f,#000914);
  color:#fff;
  min-height:100vh;
}

header{
  background:rgba(0,10,20,.96);
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(24,168,255,.3);
  padding:12px 20px;
}

.header-inner{
  max-width:1100px;
  margin:auto;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:20px;
}

.brand{
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:12px;
}

.brand img{
  width:54px;
  height:54px;
  border-radius:50%;
  object-fit:contain;
}

.brand h2{
  font-size:18px;
}

.brand span{
  display:block;
  margin-top:3px;
  color:#18a8ff;
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:bold;
}

.back{
  color:#18a8ff;
  text-decoration:none;
  font-weight:bold;
  border:1px solid #168cd3;
  padding:9px 14px;
  border-radius:7px;
}

main{
  max-width:1050px;
  margin:auto;
  padding:42px 20px;
}

.title-area{
  text-align:center;
  margin-bottom:26px;
}

.title-area img{
  width:95px;
  height:95px;
  border-radius:50%;
  object-fit:contain;
  margin:0 auto 14px;
  box-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(24,168,255,.45);
}

.title-area h1{
  font-size:34px;
}

.title-area h1 span{
  color:#18a8ff;
}

.title-area p{
  color:#b9cad7;
  margin-top:8px;
}

.live-box{
  position:relative;
  width:100%;
  max-width:900px;
  margin:auto;
  min-height:500px;
  border:1px solid rgba(24,168,255,.5);
  border-radius:14px;
  overflow:hidden;
  background:#000;
  box-shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
}

iframe{
  width:100%;
  height:500px;
  border:0;
  display:block;
  background:#000;
}

.offline{
  display:none;
  min-height:500px;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  text-align:center;
  padding:30px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at center,rgba(10,100,170,.18),transparent 50%),
    #00111f;
}

.offline-inner img{
  width:125px;
  height:125px;
  border-radius:50%;
  object-fit:contain;
  margin:0 auto 18px;
}

.offline-inner h2{
  font-size:28px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}

.offline-inner p{
  color:#b8c9d7;
  line-height:1.5;
}

.status{
  max-width:900px;
  margin:16px auto 0;
  padding:12px 14px;
  text-align:center;
  border-radius:8px;
  background:rgba(3,25,46,.95);
  border:1px solid rgba(24,168,255,.3);
  color:#bcd4e5;
}

footer{
  text-align:center;
  padding:25px 20px;
  color:#90a7b8;
  font-size:12px;
}

@media(max-width:700px){

  .header-inner{
    align-items:flex-start;
  }

  .brand h2{
    font-size:15px;
  }

  .title-area h1{
    font-size:27px;
  }

  .live-box,
  iframe,
  .offline{
    min-height:330px;
    height:330px;
  }

  iframe{
    height:330px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="header-inner">

    <div class="brand">
      <img src="log/logo-iglesia.jpeg" alt="Río de Gloria">

      <div>
        <h2>Ministerio Cristiano</h2>
        <span>Río de Gloria</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <a class="back" href="index.html">
      ← Volver
    </a>

  </div>
</header>

<main>

  <div class="title-area">

    <img
      src="log/logo-iglesia.jpeg"
      alt="Logo Río de Gloria"
    >

    <h1>
      🔴 Transmisión <span>en vivo</span>
    </h1>

    <p>
      Ministerio Cristiano Río de Gloria
    </p>

  </div>

  <div class="live-box">

    <iframe
      id="liveFrame"
      src="https://ssh101.com/securelive/index.php?id=tvriodegloria"
      allow="autoplay; fullscreen"
      allowfullscreen>
    </iframe>

    <div class="offline" id="offlineBox">

      <div class="offline-inner">

        <img
          src="log/logo-iglesia.jpeg"
          alt="Río de Gloria"
        >

        <h2>
          No hay transmisión en este momento
        </h2>

        <p>
          Cuando inicie nuestro próximo culto,
          podrás verlo desde esta página.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="status">
    🔴 Transmisión oficial del Ministerio Cristiano Río de Gloria
  </div>

</main>

<footer>
  © 2026 Ministerio Cristiano Río de Gloria
</footer>

</body>
</html>
